el catches your hair. Find a clinic to book a scalp replacement surgery.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Periodically searches for nearby Balloons, Powerful Balloons or allied units and attacks them for some time while absorbing certain SP"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":250,"def":200,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"powerful_balloon":{"slug":"powerful_balloon","name":"Powerful Balloon","icon":"/enemies-icons/Powerful Balloon.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"One of many powerful hot-air balloons that comprise the first levitating plate on Terra.\nTurn the technological legacy of the Ring Lab into children's toys, and balloons for children into a levitating plate's source of power. That is the Columbian way.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter","Grants 1 Buoyancy when on a Levitatable Zone"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":0,"def":0,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"skybreaker_soda_keg_family_size":{"slug":"skybreaker_soda_keg_family_size","name":"Skybreaker Soda Keg (Family Size)","icon":"/enemies-icons/Skybreaker Soda Keg (Family Size).webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A family-size version of the flying soda keg compresses the soda further, making it so dangerous that it was banned by the ATAO just three days after release. It packs an even bigger punch.\nPerhaps a skull with a hole in it will one day be displayed in the Columbian Aerospace Museum, commemorating the wrong turns in the development of flight technology.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Gradually accelerates when moving, but loses HP over time; the first att